    "difficulty": 6,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "B",
    "question_en": "If each datum in a set of data is multiplied by 3 and then increased by 5, which of the following remains unchanged?\nI. Range\nII. Standard Deviation\nIII. Interquartile Range",
    "question_zh": "若將一組數據中的每個數據乘以 3 再加 5，下列哪項保持不變？\nI. 全距 (Range)\nII. 標準差 (Standard Deviation)\nIII. 四分位距 (Interquartile Range)",
    "options": [
      "A. None of them",
      "B. I only",
      "C. II only",
      "D. III only"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "A",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "For a transformation $y = ax + b$:",
      " Dispersion measures (Range, SD, IQR) are multiplied by $|a|$.",
      " Here $a = 3$, so all dispersion measures will be multiplied by 3.",
      " Adding 5 ($b = 5$) does not affect dispersion, but the multiplication by 3 does.",
      " Thus, none of them remain unchanged."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "對於變換 $y = ax + b$：",
      " 離差量（全距、標準差、IQR）會乘以 $|a|$。",
      " 這裡 $a = 3$，故所有離差量都會變為原來的 3 倍。",
      " 加 5 ($b = 5$) 不影響離差量，但乘以 3 會令其改變。",
      " 因此，沒有一項保持不變。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null,
    "tags": ["statistics", "data-transformation"],
    "status": "approved"
  },
