  {
    "id": "ct_sa_337",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_alg_polynomials"],
    "marks": 9,
    "difficulty": 6,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "Let $f(x) = 2x^3 - 3x^2 + kx + 6$. When $f(x)$ is divided by $x - 2$, the remainder is $-12$.\n(a) Find the value of $k$. (3 marks)\n(b) Factorize $f(x)$ completely. (6 marks)",
    "question_zh": "設 $f(x) = 2x^3 - 3x^2 + kx + 6$。當 $f(x)$ 除以 $x - 2$ 時，餘數為 $-12$。\n(a) 求 $k$ 的值。(3分)\n(b) 將 $f(x)$ 完全因式分解。(6分)",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "(a) From Remainder Theorem, $f(2) = -12$.",
      " $2(2^3) - 3(2^2) + k(2) + 6 = -12$.",
      " $16 - 12 + 2k + 6 = -12$.",
      " $10 + 2k = -12 \\Rightarrow 2k = -22 \\Rightarrow k = -11$.",
      "(b) $f(x) = 2x^3 - 3x^2 - 11x + 6$.",
      " By Factor Theorem, test $f(3) = 2(27) - 3(9) - 11(3) + 6 = 54 - 27 - 33 + 6 = 0$.",
      " So $(x - 3)$ is a factor.",
      " Dividing $f(x)$ by $(x - 3)$: $f(x) = (x - 3)(2x^2 + 3x - 2)$.",
      " Factorize quadratic: $2x^2 + 3x - 2 = (2x - 1)(x + 2)$.",
      " Final result: $f(x) = (x - 3)(2x - 1)(x + 2)$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "(a) 根據餘數定理，$f(2) = -12$。",
      " $2(2^3) - 3(2^2) + 2k + 6 = -12$。",
      " $4 + 2k + 6 = -12 \\Rightarrow 2k = -22 \\Rightarrow k = -11$。",
      "(b) $f(x) = 2x^3 - 3x^2 - 11x + 6$。",
      " 測試 $f(3)$：$f(3) = 54 - 27 - 33 + 6 = 0$。故 $(x - 3)$ 是因式。",
      " 利用長除法：$f(x) = (x - 3)(2x^2 + 3x - 2)$。",
      " 完全因式分解：$f(x) = (x - 3)(2x - 1)(x + 2)$。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null,
    "tags": ["polynomials", "factor-theorem"],
    "status": "approved"
  },
