    "paper": 1,
    "section": "B",
    "question_en": "The figure shows a right pyramid $VABCD$ with a square base $ABCD$. The length of $AB$ is 10 cm and the height of the pyramid is 12 cm. Find the angle between the face $VAB$ and the base $ABCD$, correct to 3 significant figures.",
    "question_zh": "圖中顯示一正四角錐體 $VABCD$，其底 $ABCD$ 為正方形。$AB$ 長度為 10 cm，錐體高為 12 cm。求側面 $VAB$ 與底面 $ABCD$ 之間的夾角，準確至 3 位有效數字。",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Let $M$ be the midpoint of $AB$. Since it's a right pyramid, the center of base is $O$.",
      "The angle between face $VAB$ and base is $\\angle VMO$.",
      "In $\\triangle VMO$:",
      " Height $VO = 12$ cm.",
      " Distance $OM = AB/2 = 10/2 = 5$ cm.",
      " $\\tan(\\angle VMO) = VO / OM = 12 / 5 = 2.4$.",
      " $\\angle VMO = \\tan^{-1}(2.4) \\approx 67.380^\\circ$.",
      " Correct to 3 significant figures: 67.4°."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "設 $M$ 為 $AB$ 的中點，$O$ 為底面中心。",
      "側面與底面之夾角為 $\\angle VMO$。",
      "在直角 $\\triangle VMO$ 中：",
      " 高 $VO = 12$，底 $OM = 5$。",
      " $\\tan(\\angle VMO) = 12/5 = 2.4$。",
      " $\\angle VMO \\approx 67.4^\\circ$。"
    ],
