  {
    "id": "ct_sa_339",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_alg_linear_programming"],
    "marks": 11,
    "difficulty": 8,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "B",
    "question_en": "Consider the system of inequalities:\n$x \\ge 0, y \\ge 0, x + y \\le 6, 2x + y \\le 8$.\n(a) Sketch the feasible region. (4 marks)\n(b) Find the maximum value of $P = 3x + 2y$ within this region. (7 marks)",
    "question_zh": "考慮下列不等式組：\n$x \\ge 0, y \\ge 0, x + y \\le 6, 2x + y \\le 8$。\n(a) 繪出可解區域。(4分)\n(b) 求 $P = 3x + 2y$ 於該區域內的最大值。(7分)",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "(a) The boundary lines are $x=0, y=0, x+y=6, 2x+y=8$.",
      " Fessible vertices:",
      " 1. $(0,0)$",
      " 2. $(4,0)$ from $2x+y=8, y=0$",
      " 3. $(2,4)$ from $x+y=6, 2x+y=8$ intersection",
      " 4. $(0,6)$ from $x+y=6, x=0$",
      "(b) Test P at each vertex:",
      " At $(0,0)$: $P = 0$",
      " At $(4,0)$: $P = 3(4) + 0 = 12$",
      " At $(2,4)$: $P = 3(2) + 2(4) = 6 + 8 = 14$",
      " At $(0,6)$: $P = 3(0) + 2(6) = 12$",
      "Maximum value of $P$ is 14 at $(2,4)$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "(a) 可解區域的頂點為 $(0,0), (4,0), (2,4), (0,6)$。",
      "(b) 測試 $P = 3x + 2y$：",
      " $(0,0) \\Rightarrow P = 0$",
      " $(4,0) \\Rightarrow P = 12$",
      " $(2,4) \\Rightarrow P = 14$",
      " $(0,6) \\Rightarrow P = 12$",
      "最大值為 14。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null,
    "tags": ["linear-programming", "inequalities"],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_sa_340",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_alg_sequences"],
    "marks": 9,
    "difficulty": 7,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "B",
    "question_en": "An arithmetic progression has first term 5 and common difference 3. Find the smallest value of $n$ such that the sum of the first $n$ terms is greater than 1000.",
    "question_zh": "等差數列的首項為 5，公差為 3。求 $n$ 的最小值，使得首 $n$ 項之和高於 1000。",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Formula for sum: $S_n = \\frac{n}{2}[2a + (n-1)d]$.",
      "Substitute $a=5, d=3$: $S_n = \\frac{n}{2}[2(5) + (n-1)3] = \\frac{n}{2}[10 + 3n - 3] = \\frac{n(3n+7)}{2}$.",
      "Set $S_n > 1000 \\Rightarrow n(3n+7) > 2000$.",
      "Solve $3n^2 + 7n - 2000 = 0$ using quadratic formula:",
      " $n = \\frac{-7 \\pm \\sqrt{49 - 4(3)(-2000)}}{6} = \\frac{-7 \\pm \\sqrt{24049}}{6}$.",
      " Positive root $n \\approx \\frac{-7 + 155.077}{6} \\approx 24.68$.",
      "Since $n$ must be an integer, $n = 25$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "求和公式：$S_n = \\frac{n}{2}[2a + (n-1)d]$。",
      "代入 $a=5, d=3$：$S_n = \\frac{n(3n+7)}{2}$。",
      "設定 $S_n > 1000 \\Rightarrow n(3n+7) > 2000$。",
      "解二次方程：$3n^2 + 7n - 2000 = 0$。",
      "正根 $n \\approx 24.68$。",
      "由於 $n$ 是正整數，故 $n$ 的最小值為 25。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null,
    "tags": ["sequences", "arithmetic-progression"],
    "status": "approved"
  }
